      "created_at": "2016-03-07T22:01:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It seems to be just me, but I really dislike the oversized villains, because they take up an awkward space in the boxes, and I travel with them. &nbsp;Right now everything I own fits very neatly into the core box and the Vengeance box, but I have Villains coming in the mail, so that's about to end. &nbsp;I'm not willing to spend $55 on an empty box.</p><p>Does anyone have any plans to release normal-sized villain cards for the Vengeance and Villains expansions? &nbsp;I'd do print-and-play if that became available.</p>",
