      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-08T02:56:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I will admit that I've always wanted oversized Vengeance villain cards and oversized regular ones, since the whole deal with Vengeance types is that they're more on the same \"scale\" with heroes than solo types are.&nbsp; My collection is, of course, the exact opposite of that preference.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But, hey, that's life.&nbsp; And if I'm honest, I probably wouldn't buy an Undersized Vengeance Villain pack any more than I bought the Oversized one.</p>",
