      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-08T07:30:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No?&nbsp; Not that I am catching now, anyway.&nbsp; I may have been unclear, however.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would like: Vengeance villain cards the same size as Hero cards, oversized cards to for solo villains.</p><p>I have: oversized Vengeance villain cards, solo villain cards the same size as Hero cards.&nbsp; Sad irony.</p><p>I could buy: oversized cards for solo villains.</p><p>I have bought: not that.&nbsp; My hobby money is too dear for such an expense, with or sans foil.</p><p>My conclusion: normal-size Vengeance villain cards would be nice, but even were they available, I would not spend extra money to acquire them.&nbsp; Thus, I am probably not a good argument for GTG making such cards for sale, from a business standpoint.</p>",
